Educational Use Statement / 教学使用声明

  This platform is designed primarily for educational purposes in
  management schools (MBA, EMBA, undergraduate operations management,
  operations research, management science courses).

  本平台主要面向管理学院教学场景使用（MBA、EMBA、本科运营管理、运筹学、
  管理科学等课程）。

  Universities, business schools, and educators worldwide are
  encouraged to:

  · Use the platform freely in classroom teaching
  · Adapt the platform to local contexts (with proper citation)
  · Share improvements back to the community

  We particularly welcome contributions that:

  · Translate the interface to other languages
  · Add cases from other industries (food, pharmaceutical, electronics)
  · Improve the AI explainability features
  · Enhance the mobile experience

